        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You click a dog. It gives you bones. Some of them smell weird.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world’s most serious game about digging up increasingly bizarre bones. Click the dog. Upgrade your bone-finding tech. Get a <strong>Bone Radar</strong>. Discover a <strong>rainbow bone</strong>, a <strong>lizard bone</strong>, even a <strong>Bon Jovi bone</strong>. Why? We don't know. But you need them. All of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dog digs bones <strong>while you’re away</strong>. Wake up to a pile of bones and wonder what your life has become. Trade bones. Hoard bones. Worship bones?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dog clicking (obviously)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones with rarities and questionable origins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-digging upgrades with nonsense names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline drops, Steam Cloud, and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bone inventory bigger than your actual problems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s stupid. It’s genius. It’s <strong>Digging Dogs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You click a dog. It gives you bones. Some of them smell weird.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world’s most serious game about digging up increasingly bizarre bones. Click the dog. Upgrade your bone-finding tech. Get a <strong>Bone Radar</strong>. Discover a <strong>rainbow bone</strong>, a <strong>lizard bone</strong>, even a <strong>Bon Jovi bone</strong>. Why? We don't know. But you need them. All of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dog digs bones <strong>while you’re away</strong>. Wake up to a pile of bones and wonder what your life has become. Trade bones. Hoard bones. Worship bones?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dog clicking (obviously)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones with rarities and questionable origins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-digging upgrades with nonsense names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline drops, Steam Cloud, and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bone inventory bigger than your actual problems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s stupid. It’s genius. It’s <strong>Digging Dogs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
